EXTERNAL Transition(from,to)
EXTERNAL unlockItem(name)
EXTERNAL unlockNPC(name)
EXTERNAL TransitionToMainGame(from,to)



This is the deduction page. This is where you put to use all the the evidence you gather during your investigation.
Use your clues, character statements, and deductive skills to determine the correct answer for each question and reveal the murderer to the public!
Or at least, reveal whoever could <i>feasibly</i> be the murderer... 

"Mandatory" questions must be answered correctly to produce a publishable article.
"Optional" questions, while not essential to the article's success, will increase your overall pay if answered correctly.

There are also side scandals for you to discover in each case which, if you publish, can get you a little extra pay as well! 
Just be mindful that what you choose to publish will have consequences, both good and bad.
You may also choose to not publish a side scandal if its publication would have undesirable repercussions.
And should you fail to make enough money to support your family, there may well be severe personal consequences...
Good luck in your investigation, sir! One last tip: if you're looking to skip through dialogue, you can click the right-mouse button to fast-forward through the scrolling text.
~Transition("Intro Deduction", "Study")
->DONE